11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, maybe. But I’m counting the actual hours, not just the mess. I need to see where the time really goes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your paperwork will reveal the fixed burden. I hope we find the truth lies in the details, not the assumptions.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, your numbers are just facts. I’m digging into why people stop talking. That’s the real danger here.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, fair point. But without the real costs, we’re just guessing. I’ll find the actual numbers so we stop winging it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
